    <title>SRTBOT</title>
    <link href="/2026/10/05/SRTBOT/"/>
    <url>/2026/10/05/SRTBOT/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><strong>MIT6.006</strong>中给出了<strong>SRTBOT</strong>的dp算法设计方法，本文记录笔者的理解。</p></blockquote><h3 id="框架解释"><a href="#框架解释" class="headerlink" title="框架解释:"></a>框架解释:</h3><table><thead><tr><th><span style="white-space:nowrap">步骤</span></th><th>名称</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>S</strong></td><td><strong>Subproblems</strong></td><td>定义子问题（下文记为 subprobs）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>R</strong></td><td><strong>Relate</strong> subproblems recursively</td><td>用更小的子问题递归地表示</td></tr><tr><td><strong>T</strong></td><td><strong>Topological order</strong> on subprobs</td><td>确定求解顺序（保证 <strong>DAG</strong>，读者不妨思考原因）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>B</strong></td><td><strong>Base</strong> case</td><td>关系无法继续展开时直接给出答案</td></tr><tr><td><strong>O</strong></td><td><strong>Original problem</strong> via subprobs</td><td>原问题对应哪个子问题</td></tr><tr><td><strong>T</strong></td><td><strong>Time</strong> analysis</td><td>时间分析</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h4 id="例子1-Bowling"><a href="#例子1-Bowling" class="headerlink" title="例子1(Bowling):"></a>例子1(Bowling):</h4><ul><li>给定 <strong>n</strong> 个球瓶，编号 $0, \dots, n-1$</li><li>球瓶 $i$ 的<strong>价值</strong>为 $v_i$</li><li>击中 <strong>1</strong> 个球瓶 $i$，得 $v_i$ 分</li><li>击中<strong>相邻 2 个</strong>球瓶 $i$ 和 $i+1$，得 $v_i \cdot v_{i+1}$ 分</li><li>球瓶被击中后即被<strong>移除</strong>，不能再被击中</li><li>目标：扔出 <strong>0 个或更多</strong>球，<strong>最大化</strong>总分</li></ul><p>按 <strong>SRTBOT</strong> 展开：</p><table><thead><tr><th><span style="white-space:nowrap">步骤</span></th><th>内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>S</strong></td><td>$B(i)$：只考虑球瓶 $[i, n-1]$ 时的最大得分</td></tr><tr><td><strong>R</strong></td><td>$B(i) &#x3D; \max(v_i + B(i+1),\ v_i \cdot v_{i+1} + B(i+2),\ B(i+1))$<br>局部穷举三种选择：单独击中 &#x2F; 一起击中 &#x2F; 跳过</td></tr><tr><td><strong>T</strong></td><td>$i$ 递减</td></tr><tr><td><strong>B</strong></td><td>$B(n) &#x3D; B(n+1) &#x3D; 0$</td></tr><tr><td><strong>O</strong></td><td>$B(0)$</td></tr><tr><td><strong>T</strong></td><td>$\Theta(n) \cdot \Theta(1) &#x3D; \Theta(n)$（下面会给出一般方法）</td></tr></tbody></table><p>不难发现，解决的关键在于S和R，而二者又是紧密联系的；下面给出S和R的选取技巧。</p><blockquote><p><strong>S</strong>: </p><ul><li><strong>subsets</strong> of input: <strong>prefix</strong>, <strong>suffix</strong>(例子1), <strong>substring(contiguous)</strong>, 具体选择根据问题特征，通常前两个可以互换</li><li><strong>integers</strong></li><li><strong>multiply</strong> possible subsets across multiple inputs (这里的multiply笔者认为可以理解成<strong>笛卡尔积</strong>)</li><li>record partial state by add <strong>auxiliary variables</strong> (当R处理困难时，通过增广记录状态简化R)</li></ul></blockquote><blockquote><p><strong>R</strong>: <strong>Guess</strong> + <strong>Induction</strong></p><ul><li>处理recursive的问题，<strong>归纳验证</strong>是通法</li></ul></blockquote><hr><h3 id="如何实现呢"><a href="#如何实现呢" class="headerlink" title="如何实现呢?"></a>如何实现呢?</h3><p>先看一个耳熟能详的例子</p><h4 id="例子2-Fibonacci"><a href="#例子2-Fibonacci" class="headerlink" title="例子2(Fibonacci):"></a>例子2(Fibonacci):</h4><ul><li>$F_n &#x3D; F_{n-1} + F_{n-2}$, $F_0 &#x3D; 0$, $F_1 &#x3D; 1$</li><li>给定 $N$，求 $F_N$?</li></ul><p>使用前文提到的<strong>SRTBOT</strong>方法(<strong>S</strong>, <strong>R</strong>几乎是显然的):</p><table><thead><tr><th><span style="white-space:nowrap">步骤</span></th><th>内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>S</strong></td><td>$F(i)$：第 $i$ 个 Fibonacci 数 (integer)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>R</strong></td><td>$F(i) &#x3D; F(i-1) + F(i-2)$</td></tr><tr><td><strong>T</strong></td><td>$i$ 递增</td></tr><tr><td><strong>B</strong></td><td>$F(0) &#x3D; 0$，$F(1) &#x3D; 1$</td></tr><tr><td><strong>O</strong></td><td>$F(N)$</td></tr></tbody></table><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">fib</span>(<span class="hljs-params">n</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> n &lt; <span class="hljs-number">2</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> n <span class="hljs-comment"># base case</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> fib(n - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) + fib(n - <span class="hljs-number">2</span>) <span class="hljs-comment"># recurrence</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p><strong>T</strong>: $T(n) &#x3D; T(n-1) + T(n-2) + O(1) &gt; 2T(n-2)$, 指数级… :(</p></blockquote><p>聪明的读者肯定发现了问题：$F(k)$（$1 \le k \le n$）被计算了 $F(n-k+1)$ 次！<br>问题在于：<strong>DAG</strong> 被朴素递归展开成了 <strong>tree</strong>！</p><p>如何<strong>复用</strong>subprobs的解呢？两种实现方法(也就是熟知的<strong>recursive</strong>和<strong>iterative</strong>):</p><p>把subprobs画成DAG:</p><ul><li><strong>Top down</strong>:<ul><li>核心: <strong>memo</strong>存储 + <strong>recursion</strong></li></ul></li></ul><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">fib</span>(<span class="hljs-params">n</span>): <br>    memo = &#123;&#125; <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">F</span>(<span class="hljs-params">i</span>): <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> i &lt; <span class="hljs-number">2</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> i <span class="hljs-comment"># base case</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> memo: <span class="hljs-comment"># check memo</span><br>            memo[i] = F(i - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) + F(i - <span class="hljs-number">2</span>) <span class="hljs-comment"># relation</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> memo[i]<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> F(n) <span class="hljs-comment"># original</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>一般写法：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">f</span>(<span class="hljs-params">subprob</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> subprob <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> memo:<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> memo[subprob]<br>    basecase check<br>    memo[s] = ...<br>    recurse via relation<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>Bottom up</strong>:<ul><li>核心: <strong>Topological order</strong></li></ul></li></ul><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">fib</span>(<span class="hljs-params">subprob</span>): <br>    F = &#123;&#125; <br>    F[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>], F[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-comment"># base cases</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, n + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>): <span class="hljs-comment"># topological order </span><br>        F[i] = F[i - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>] + F[i - <span class="hljs-number">2</span>] <span class="hljs-comment"># relation</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> F[n] <span class="hljs-comment"># original</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>一般写法：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">f</span>(<span class="hljs-params">n</span>):<br>    init basecases<br>    topological order loop:<br>        relation<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> original<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>那么时间如何计算?</p><h3 id="T-的一般算法"><a href="#T-的一般算法" class="headerlink" title="T 的一般算法:"></a>T 的一般算法:</h3><blockquote><ol><li><strong>num</strong> of subprobs: $N_1$</li><li>work <strong>per</strong> subprob: $N_2$ (non-recursive, 把 recursions 视为 $O(1)$ 时间)</li><li>$T &#x3D; N_1 \cdot N_2$</li></ol></blockquote><p>回到例子：</p><table><thead><tr><th>例子</th><th>$N_1$ (num of subprobs)</th><th>$N_2$ (work per subprob)</th><th>$T &#x3D; N_1 \cdot N_2$</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Bowling</strong></td><td>$O(N)$</td><td>$O(1)$</td><td>$O(N)$</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fibonacci</strong></td><td>$O(N)$</td><td>$\text{addition}$</td><td>$O(N^2&#x2F;w)$</td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote><p><strong>Fibonacci</strong>：</p><blockquote><p>$F_i \approx \frac{\phi^i}{\sqrt{5}}$<sup id="fnref:1" class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn:1" rel="footnote"><span class="hint--top hint--rounded" aria-label="$\phi$ 是黄金分割比">[1]</span></a></sup> 的位长为 $\Theta(i)$，是<strong>大数</strong><br><strong>addition 并非 $O(1)$</strong>: $N_2&#x3D; O(\lceil N&#x2F;w \rceil)$<sup id="fnref:2" class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn:2" rel="footnote"><span class="hint--top hint--rounded" aria-label="参考 **Word-RAM** ($w$ 为机器字长)">[2]</span></a></sup> $T &#x3D; O(N) \cdot O(\lceil N&#x2F;w \rceil) &#x3D; O(N^2&#x2F;w)$。</p></blockquote></blockquote><p>这是否是 <strong>polynomial time</strong>(多项式时间)?</p><h4 id="Polynomial-Time"><a href="#Polynomial-Time" class="headerlink" title="Polynomial Time:"></a>Polynomial Time:</h4><ul><li><p>令 $T &#x3D; O(f)$</p></li><li><p><strong>(strongly) polynomial time</strong>: $f$ 关于 input $\text{size}$ 是多项式</p></li><li><p><strong>pseudopolynomial time</strong><sup id="fnref:3" class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn:3" rel="footnote"><span class="hint--top hint--rounded" aria-label="**p**不发音, **pseudo-** 是 **prefix**: **伪-**">[3]</span></a></sup> (伪多项式): $f$ 关于 input $\text{size}$ 和 $\text{integers}$ 是多项式</p></li><li><p>E.g., Fibonacci:</p><ul><li>$\text{size} &#x3D; O(\log N)$<sup id="fnref:4" class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn:4" rel="footnote"><span class="hint--top hint--rounded" aria-label="默认以 $2$ 为底">[4]</span></a></sup>, $\text{integers} &#x3D; N$</li><li>$T &#x3D; O(\text{integers}^2&#x2F;w) &#x3D; O(4^{\text{size}}&#x2F;w)$</li><li>是 $\text{integers}$ 的多项式，不是 $\text{size}$ 的多项式</li><li>故为<strong>伪多项式时间</strong></li></ul></li></ul><hr><p>未完待续……</p><section class="footnotes"><div class="footnote-list"><ol><li><span id="fn:1" class="footnote-text"><span>$\phi$ 是黄金分割比<a href="#fnref:1" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:2" class="footnote-text"><span>参考 <strong>Word-RAM</strong> ($w$ 为机器字长)<a href="#fnref:2" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:3" class="footnote-text"><span><strong>p</strong>不发音, <strong>pseudo-</strong> 是 <strong>prefix</strong>: <strong>伪-</strong><a href="#fnref:3" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:4" class="footnote-text"><span>默认以 $2$ 为底<a href="#fnref:4" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li></ol></div></section>]]></content>
    
    
